{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/1d8daa952eff2b2cb99468dc551f7f88.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/902749dcf5ac1ed570b8acccdd441bf0.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=92 /></span><br>In Toto's Journey, you play as Toto, a brave and loyal dog who has been swept away to a fairytale world by a magical tornado. Separated from his beloved owner Dorothy, Toto sets off on a perilous adventure to find her, make new allies, and uncover the mysteries of this enchanted land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.poster.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.webm?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.mp4?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/6bf0948932d2eb6a3cc268c9b81c79d2.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=92 /></span><br>You will venture into a magical realm filled with the most extraordinary locations: from the dense forests where the Lion hides to the mechanical ruins of the Tin Woodman - each one presents its own unique challenge for Toto.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.poster.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.webm?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.mp4?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/29e5ceb19f3f1b621a8c7d9240bb0deb.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=92 /></span><br>Along the way, you'll encounter puzzles that will test your wit and creativity. Open up passages, restore broken artifacts, and manipulate light and shadow to unveil the ancient secrets of this world. With every solved puzzle, Toto grows stronger, unlocking new magical abilities to aid him in his quest for Dorothy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.poster.avif?t=1772715846\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.webm?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.mp4?t=1772715846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/d3574ffc2dfdd825c2f2d8f294d843f3.avif?t=1772715846\" width=780 height=92 /></span><br>Toto's Journey is a heartwarming adventure filled with mystery, friendship, and discovery. Explore the secrets of a magical world, meet new compan